    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Gilgit-Baltistan has taken the bold step of developing a 15-year education strategy that aims to achieve universal primary education for girls and boys equally, and to encourage the lifelong skills needed for people to survive and thrive. In support, the University's Institute for Educational Development and its Professional Development Centre, North has secured two grants to support the public education sector.",
